	<key>Editable cursor</key>
	<string>可编辑指针</string>
	<key>Editable cursor records the pointer separately so the editor can smooth it, resize it, and keep it crisp when zoomed — the video editor adds it back on export (the raw recording file has no pointer). Auto-zoom makes a fresh recording open already produced: the camera zooms to follow your clicks. Keyboard shortcuts records only ⌘, ⌃ and ⌥ combos (plus Esc and F-keys) so the editor can show them as keycaps — plain typing is never recorded; macOS asks for Accessibility access. High quality is the default; Max keeps more detail but creates larger files. The countdown gives you a moment after pressing Record; Esc cancels it. Stop a recording with %@ from any app — plain Esc stays with the app you're recording.</key>
	<string>“可编辑指针”会单独记录指针，以便编辑器将其平滑、调整大小，并在缩放时保持清晰 — 视频编辑器会在导出时将指针加回（原始录制文件中不含指针）。开启自动缩放后，新录制内容打开时就已制作完成：镜头会跟随你的点按。“显示快捷键”只记录含 ⌘、⌃ 和 ⌥ 的组合键（以及 Esc 键和功能键），以便编辑器将其显示为按键 — 普通输入绝不会被记录；macOS 会请求辅助功能权限。默认使用“高”质量；“最高”保留更多细节，但文件更大。倒计时让你在开始录制后有片刻准备；按 Esc 键可取消。在任何 App 中按 %@ 都能停止录制 — 单独按 Esc 键仍会传给你正在录制的 App。</string>
